# Density Compare
# Fluorine (F) — real density 0.0017 g/cm³. equal masses: Fluorine vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Fluorine Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 167.4mm color: #90e050 at (-20mm, 83.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
